mpanies.", "Recent regulations have eased access for non-accredited investors to invest in private companies through crowdfunding platforms."], "updates": ["Non-accredited investors cannot directly invest in OpenAI but can invest in related public companies like NVIDIA and AMD.", "Starting a venture capital firm involves multiple steps including business planning, capital raising, due diligence, and portfolio management.", "AI-focused venture capital firms require specialized knowledge of the AI industry and private market funding dynamics."], "unresolved": ["Whether a venture capital firm registered outside the US can successfully source funds specifically for OpenAI remains dependent on legal and company policies.", "The exact current funding needs of OpenAI may vary according to company strategy and plans."], "source_message_count": 1, "first_message_at": "2023-03-06T19:54:00+00:00", "last_message_at": "2023-03-06T19:54:00+00:00", "entities": [{"entity_id": 645, "name": "OpenAI", "source_message_count": 1, "first_seen_at": "2023-03-06T19:54:00+00:00", "last_seen_at": "2023-03-06T19:54:00+00:00"}, {"entity_id": 646, "name": "NVIDIA", "source_message_count": 1, "first_seen_at": "2023-03-06T19:54:00+00:00", "last_seen_at": "2023-03-06T19:54:00+00:00"}, {"entity_id": 647, "name": "AMD", "source_message_count": 1, "first_seen_at": "2023-03-06T19:54:00+00:00", "last_seen_at": "2023-03-06T19:54:00+00:00"}, {"entity_id": 648, "name": "Securities and Exchange Commission", "source_message_count": 1, "first_seen_at": "2023-03-06T19:54:00+00:00", "last_seen_at": "2023-03-06T19:54:00+00:00"}], "relationships": [{"relationship_id": "c0764c50-ad4e-440e-97f0-6e75021de8b1:645:646:partners with", "source": "OpenAI", "relationship_type": "partners with", "target": "NVIDIA", "source_message_count": 1}, {"relationship_id": "c0764c50-ad4e-440e-97f0-6e75021de8b1:645:647:partners with", "source": "OpenAI", "relationship_type": "partners with", "target": "AMD", "source_message_count": 1}